  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "一百零五天。",
      "sha256": "6df98879dd419b9f1cc4df75fa53b0cc06525a7f93ea604ee6315ff81c68cbad",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0.0,
      "target_duration": 2,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 1.312,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.688
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "一个女人死了105天，她的丈夫，却用她的微信，陪她妈妈聊了105天。",
      "sha256": "69cb22da0d18bbb29a50c47a4cc79c3c8e612ebf05eca18467f1916b9cc96690",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 2.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.861,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.139
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "这是2017年震惊上海的冰柜藏尸案。",
      "sha256": "86d4f6d0d539455987e66348def4e6e2b4530e26f3ef4cd5f052d2623427acd7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 9.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.75,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "朱晓东和杨俪萍，曾是让人羡慕的一对——他做商场职员，她是小学老师，朋友圈里全是旅行和甜蜜合影。",
      "sha256": "41668332c1c87d25ee684499d8269e802d632655b32ba8b37dd2fcfec00ca9a0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 14.0,
      "target_duration": 10,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 10.101,
      "atempo": 1.0101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "可谁都没想到，这段婚姻走到最后，只剩下一台冰柜。",
      "sha256": "a6781ba0c4f0d89c303ba7d739c5b81c1c8648779231a7be74f040b712e124ea",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "时间回到2016年10月17日。",
      "sha256": "d10bc60f4d94d18f8db567db5a9307afa0d572837fc0e5be803d27654940ea78",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 30.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.32,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.68
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "那天晚上，两人发生争执，",
      "sha256": "8a0b214b9f5ba15ac5b52579f74d4eb6f613abe906ee6ed8a97476f2693951e6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 34.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.937,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.063
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "朱晓东在家中杀害了妻子。",
      "sha256": "db412896d188d4256963f63c4b0f8b2ae6de27678524fa41e0f75794324cde91",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 38.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 1.614,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.386
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "面对突如其来的尸体，他没报警，也没逃跑——",
      "sha256": "96b30d7d1c00759489ab1b40fbb7af0f011e5d56e5d02ab4c59cd81b98c0ba22",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.261,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.739
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他做了一个正常人无法理解的决定：把妻子藏进冰柜，然后，假装她还活着。",
      "sha256": "b807a1afa51f9a4175af806a914b86d3f8b72cec36c624a7421d61a2f85288f0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 47.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.546,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.454
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "接下来的105天，是这起案件最让人脊背发凉的部分。",
      "sha256": "7887c15b4f8d8a3db398f055e71ed5ce1d1c437d71d6c1c7d1d386aa88b4d431",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 56.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "朱晓东拿着妻子的手机，冒充她发朋友圈、回微信，",
      "sha256": "ca82169c3cb6323b7bf4b89bfc38f350a200901665012cfc09887247267816ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 62.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.644,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.356
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "和她的父母、朋友、同事聊天，语气温柔，滴水不漏。",
      "sha256": "902f344eb6d7a871acf0e28034b477b07106208ee87c006ded6e809c4e3633ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 68.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.095,
      "atempo": 1.0159,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "母亲问“怎么不接电话”，",
      "sha256": "645b95bfdef47d540f7ca0784d922936d70adee832a4d1e607e9d0ec9ffe7b4c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 74.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.299,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.701
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "他回“在忙，别担心”。",
      "sha256": "14e7720d3a76c61bc294f4107fe1ae25e4da3a526c013369509172a0c584cb7e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 78.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.473,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.527
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "与此同时，他拿妻子的身份证开房、",
      "sha256": "c6474d4a17154d4aa35c742c00fea487c308daa01ec89978e7981733ea5733e1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 82.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.495,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.505
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "和别的女人约会，把日子过得风生水起。",
      "sha256": "fc6797e56e7c4eae0bd3fec7e5c6fce2af51eda2eb3e5a40c1c297e097704d6d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 87.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.541,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.459
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "妻子就躺在冰柜里，而他在演一场没人看穿的独角戏。",
      "sha256": "568e34c86370ed56ab9c8cda94c9461ee0739ffdf13516030c70e2916a17440e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.201,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.799
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "可再完美的表演，也有穿帮的一天。",
      "sha256": "bcee90bb1e220a4d991dda9e2a1bbcab928ee57cd46344a3d5102804e21d39a0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 98.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.065,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.935
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "杨俪萍的母亲一个多月联系不上女儿，发微信总回得莫名其妙。",
      "sha256": "ff3670aa79ae604331561f3d8bd9a7917a00287836e9d857d46ff5c12d02da04",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 103.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.84,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.16
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "父亲越想越不对劲：",
      "sha256": "36a1cc2b129710f02333f392d3403c3df54aea4cb8492189e42644dcb8308655",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 1.707,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.293
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "女儿头像换了，说话口气也不像她。",
      "sha256": "bfd44e228494c94309cd77658281caafe1acaf816021bcd057b3d996c1fdb9e5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.448,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.552
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "2017年2月1日，大年初五，父亲报了警。",
      "sha256": "188fd22f040cc556eec8bf415993a5603e1834f21acf1142814eba9feddec9bd",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 119.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.261,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.739
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "当警察跟着朱晓东回家，",
      "sha256": "245595cef3a45e0b1e33982deaff2b812d22bf04988e2c50cf65a0dc77952eb4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 125.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.171,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.829
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "拉开那台冰柜时，在场所有人都愣住了。",
      "sha256": "ddd4c5fca69a3c35a3d1de35394664e279804043db9da8ed860f8ce256af55d3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 129.0,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.342,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.658
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "真相大白。法庭上，朱晓东一度辩解说是冲动，但铁证如山。",
      "sha256": "113d025a96987e40bde13197451ac4e576729ce979790d1811fadbb9a16d7bfc",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.223,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.777
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "一审被判死刑，二审维持原判，最高人民法院核准。",
      "sha256": "8de5ff2fa8ad4ae3babdacaaa5fc748d0e37f523f25155507ecd10e5b819da89",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 144.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "2019年1月，朱晓东被执行死刑，年仅32岁。那台冰柜，成了最刺眼的注脚。",
      "sha256": "a609ffa47c52b8ddb7f55e6ae9dc1fb488de7eba7a382745b03ca5e7407cca63",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 151.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.661,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.339
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "这个案子最恐怖的，不是手段，而是那105天——他能把最亲密的爱人当成“不存在”，一边藏尸，一边笑着说“我很好”。",
      "sha256": "c7afef44bc51fcdafe5d2eae7b2f5148badefcb1189c5b0c3f348c7e2a47a133",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 160.0,
      "target_duration": 13,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 11.854,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.146
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "如果你是她父母，第几天会发现不对劲？评论区聊聊。",
      "sha256": "e200bbe1e31cf85c6ae75a4f5caeac1a0e7449f065e7a144480b6581a0db06f7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 173.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.563,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.437
    }
  ]
}
